### Login
# @name login
POST http://localhost:3333/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "usuarioteste10@email.com",
  "password": "Senha@123"
}

### Refresh
# @name refresh
POST http://localhost:3333/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{login.response.body.refreshToken}}"
}

### Reusar o refresh token antigo (deve retornar 401)
POST http://localhost:3333/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{login.response.body.refreshToken}}"
}

### Logout
POST http://localhost:3333/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{refresh.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refresh.response.body.refreshToken}}"
}

### Logout de todas as sessões
POST http://localhost:3333/api/auth/logout-all
Authorization: Bearer {{refresh.response.body.accessToken}}

### Senha errada (deve retornar 401)
POST http://localhost:3333/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "usuarioteste10@email.com",
  "password": "Errada@123"
}

### Logout sem token (deve retornar 401)
POST http://localhost:3333/api/auth/logout